    <div class="practice" data-choice-gap-drill data-success-message="Correct. You retrieved future-reference present form, the unless exception, and a weaker possible result.">
      <h3>Choose from memory before looking back</h3>
      <div class="choice-bank" aria-label="Next-day conditional choices"><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="starts">starts</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="will start">will start</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="Unless">Unless</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="Unless doesn’t">Unless doesn’t</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="might arrive">might arrive</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="will definitely arrive">will definitely arrive</button></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">1</span><span>The rain condition is future but remains open: If the rain <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="starts" data-hint="Use present starts in the core future condition." data-fix="If the rain starts, we’ll move inside." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button>, we’ll move inside.</span></div>
